    "Id": "chassisdef_wolfhound_WLF-QSC",
    "Name": "Wolfhound",
    "Details": "ntroducing the Quicsell Wolfhound – Chemical Carnage, Laser Defense! This specialized variant features an exclusively chemical arsenal with Quicsell's cutting-edge laser AMS. Embrace the lightened structure for nimble maneuvers on the battlefield. Unleash the full power of chemical lasers and trust Quicsell's laser AMS to keep you protected. The Quicsell Wolfhound: Where agility meets chemical mayhem!\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Quicksell Clan Mech</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.98</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limit: Right Lower</color>",
