  "StockRole": "Sniper & Light Brawler",
  "YangsThoughts": "Boss, they're selling this Quicsell Wolfhound – all chemical lasers and a fancy laser AMS. Lightened structure for agility, sure, but chemical lasers mean you're playing with volatile ammo. And that laser AMS? It sounds like a lot of glitz for a Wolfhound. I'd be cautious – chemical carnage might just turn into a Mech meltdown when you least expect it. Flashy promises, but I'm not sold on the practicality.",
